First stage entirely outside the viewport: engine sets cursor target instead of showing completion directly.
row: 2
col: 0
viewportTop: 1
viewportBottom: 10
-- buffer.txt --
line 1
line 2
line 3
line 4
line 5
line 6
line 7
line 8
